      "message": "Yeah, I think you are right. @jaszczyk@google.com FYI\n\n\u003e And pkvm_hyp_mmu_map ultimately calls hyp_mmu_flush_tlb which BUG()s.\n\nAt first I thought \"wut?\" :) but now I think I get you: in this case it will modify PTEs for already mapped pages, thus triggering flush_tlb. (So we are kind of safe that it\u0027s guaranteed to be only a DoS, but still it is a bug.)",
